		{
			dependencies: ["5A60751EB3771E5A"]
			id: "5B47CA991C15A9AE"
			subtitle: "&dIndustrial hemp seeds&r can be found by breaking &egras&r, and the &efiber&r they produce can be used in various recipes, including making &estring&r.&r"
